{"id":"wb-8-336","name":"福寿沟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"福寿沟","text":"福寿沟是中国江西省赣州市老城的一座大型地下水利工程，始建于北宋时期，由时任虔州知军刘彝主持修建。福寿沟既是赣州城区的防洪排涝工程，也是城区污水处理的综合治理工程，属于“雨污合流制”管网系统。在降雨量较大的时节，赣州城得益于福寿沟的排涝作用，没有发生其他城市严重内涝的现象，福寿沟经过之地均无积水点。在2016年的洪灾中，福寿沟起到了保护了赣州城区免遭洪水侵袭的作用。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BF%E6%B2%9F","revisionId":93619622,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93619622","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7d9e4de6752e741131ac36a6.jpg","title":"20260504-福寿沟.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260504-%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BF%E6%B2%9F.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/20260504-%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BF%E6%B2%9F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"BMSBridge","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​江西省赣州市境内的全国重点文物保护单位——福寿沟","width":320,"height":240}}